{"uid":"b3c3840c4f6b2e35","name":"test_agent_with_toolkit_executes_in_chat","fullName":"tests.ui.chat.test_agent_with_toolkit_chat.TestAgentWithToolkitInChat#test_agent_with_toolkit_executes_in_chat","historyId":"62d9cb8ce7640606c5f432e8044591dc","time":{"start":1783687035707,"stop":1783687067497,"duration":31790},"description":"Create agent with toolkit, add agent as participant in chat, verify toolkit executes.\n\n        The toolkit is attached to the agent (not the conversation directly).\n        This tests the agent-owns-toolkit execution path in real chat (/app/chat).\n\n        Steps:\n        1. Navigate to agent detail page\n        2. Add GitHub toolkit to agent via UI\n        3. Verify toolkit is attached, then save and wait for persistence\n        4. Navigate to conversation and let page settle\n        5. Add agent as participant\n        6. Send message asking to list branches\n        7. Wait for AI + toolkit response to stabilise\n        8. Verify response contains branch/repository data from toolkit\n        ","descriptionHtml":"<p>Create agent with toolkit, add agent as participant in chat, verify toolkit executes.</p>\n<pre><code>    The toolkit is attached to the agent (not the conversation directly).\n    This tests the agent-owns-toolkit execution path in real chat (/app/chat).\n\n    Steps:\n    1. Navigate to agent detail page\n    2. Add GitHub toolkit to agent via UI\n    3. Verify toolkit is attached, then save and wait for persistence\n    4. Navigate to conversation and let page settle\n    5. Add agent as participant\n    6. Send message asking to list branches\n    7. Wait for AI + toolkit response to stabilise\n    8. Verify response contains branch/repository data from toolkit\n</code></pre>\n","status":"failed","statusMessage":"AssertionError: Expected toolkit response to include the known branch 'main'. Response: I’m sorry, but I don’t have access to the GitHub toolkit in this chat, so I can’t execute it or fetch the live branch list for EliteaAI/elitea-testing directly.\n  If you want to list them yourself, this GitHub CLI command will return the branch names:\n  If you can enable the GitHub tool here, I can then\nassert 'main' in 'I\\u2019m sorry, but I don\\u2019t have access to the GitHub toolkit in this chat, so I can\\u2019t execute it or fetch the live branch list for EliteaAI/elitea-testing directly.\\nIf you want to list them yourself, this GitHub CLI command will return the branch names:\\nIf you can enable the GitHub tool here, I can then list the actual branch names for you.'","statusTrace":"tests/ui/chat/test_agent_with_toolkit_chat.py:198: in test_agent_with_toolkit_executes_in_chat\n    assert expected_branch in last_content, (\nE   AssertionError: Expected toolkit response to include the known branch 'main'. Response: I’m sorry, but I don’t have access to the GitHub toolkit in this chat, so I can’t execute it or fetch the live branch list for EliteaAI/elitea-testing directly.\nE     If you want to list them yourself, this GitHub CLI command will return the branch names:\nE     If you can enable the GitHub tool here, I can then\nE   assert 'main' in 'I\\u2019m sorry, but I don\\u2019t have access to the GitHub toolkit in this chat, so I can\\u2019t execute it or fetch the live branch list for EliteaAI/elitea-testing directly.\\nIf you want to list them yourself, this GitHub CLI command will return the branch names:\\nIf you can enable the GitHub tool here, I can then list the actual branch names for you.'","flaky":false,"newFailed":false,"newBroken":false,"newPassed":false,"retriesCount":0,"retriesStatusChange":false,"beforeStages":[{"name":"pytestconfig","time":{"start":1783686673072,"stop":1783686673073,"duration":1},"status":"passed","steps":[],"attachments":[],"parameters":[],"shouldDisplayMessage":false,"stepsCount":0,"attachmentsCount":0,"hasContent":false,"attachmentStep":false},{"name":"base_url","time":{"start":1783686673073,"stop":1783686673073,"duration":0},"stat